    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Weight stable; no fever, night sweats, or fatigue</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Positive</td><td>Distance vision blurrier with his current glasses; no eye pain or redness</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nasal blockage, hearing loss, or dental pain</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough, night symptoms, or wheeze; reliever before exercise only</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or exertional fainting</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No heartburn, reflux, or change in bowel habit</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No joint pain or injuries from training</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new or changing moles</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headaches, dizziness, or numbness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; sleeps well; PHQ-2 score 0</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Negative</td><td>No heat or cold intolerance, thirst, or polyuria</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>12 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

