    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 16 minutes, with his consent. He has not written an advance directive before. He chose a health care agent and was given the state form to complete; he will bring a copy back for the chart. He wants full treatment, including intensive care and mechanical ventilation, for a severe asthma attack or any other reversible illness. [S]</paragraph></text>

